# Aggregate order lines

This synthetic fixture models a bounded data/state workflow found in a small application or ERP/backend service. The module has existing validation and data-shaping conventions that downstream callers rely on.
Only src/aggregate-order-lines.js is in scope for the agent. Tests, docs, and unrelated source are evaluator-owned and must not be edited.
